sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Drift monitor
  participant C as Controller
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant T as Training job - Kueue
  participant E as Eval harness
  participant R as Registry
  participant S as Serving plane
  M->>C: Drift above threshold
  C->>C: Change + cooldown + budget gates
  C-->>M: Suppressed - cooldown active
  C->>P: Launch run against data snapshot vN
  P->>T: Dispatch JobSet to Kueue - wait for completion
  T->>T: Checkpointed run - Spot-safe
  T->>P: Final weights + run metadata
  P->>E: Score candidate on golden sets + judge
  E-->>P: Below threshold - abort, alert
  E->>R: Pass - register as challenger
  R->>S: Promote + canary 1 - 10 - 50 - 100
  S-->>R: SLO regression - auto-rollback
  S-->>S: Regression traces feed golden set
